[[2047,127,65536,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Remove the courtesy light (1a).</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Use a screwdriver via the slot\n(1b).</p></aside><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connections.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Rear (centre courtesy light)</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236040\">G20</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. If necessary, remove the bulb from the retaining clip.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019272.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,65536,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the courtesy light is undamaged.</p><p>If removed, engage the bulb in the retaining\nspring.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection</p><p>Fit the courtesy light.</p><p>Check that the bulb is working.</p>"]]